        "mission_intent": "Team, following the latest round of finished intelligence dissemination to senior policymakers, we've received feedback from several cabinet-level consumers indicating that our current assessments on emerging cyber threats from non-state actors in Southeast Asia lack sufficient depth on alternative scenarios and potential implications for U.S. security interests. Analysts on the Southeast Asia desk have confirmed they've identified specific collection gaps around adversary command-and-control infrastructure and recruitment networks, but we need those gaps formally documented and translated into validated collection requirements routed through the appropriate channels. Please coordinate with theanalytic team to capture each identified gap, develop corresponding collection requirements with justification tied to current national priorities, and submit them into the requirements management system for tasking across relevant collection disciplines. Ensure each requirement includes a clear description of the information needed and how it supports the broader assessment, and flag any requirements that may need deconfliction with ongoing operations in the region. I'd like the initial set of requirements drafted and ready for review by end of next week so we can brief the deputy director on our plan to close these gaps before the next PDB cycle.",
